# Alliance AI inactivity nudge (WhatsApp) — auto free-text follow-up after a lead
# replies once then goes quiet again, within the 24h WhatsApp session window.
# Quiet window is dynamic: it follows each contact's own campaign "first reminder
# after" setting (alliance_whatsapp_campaigns.followup_delay_minutes/_days) — no
# fixed minutes value here.
